{"unit_id": "tag:0F1N:statement", "translation": "设<MATH_0001>是一个域（field）。设<MATH_0002>在<MATH_0003>中可逆（invertible）。考虑交换图（commutative diagram）\n<MATH_0004>\n，其中各项均为<MATH_0005>上的有限型（finite type）概形（schemes），满足<MATH_0006>和<MATH_0007>。典范映射（canonical map）\n<MATH_0008>\n对于<MATH_0009>位于<MATH_0010>中以及<MATH_0011>位于<MATH_0012>中的情形，是一个同构（isomorphism）。\n", "allowed_english": [], "term_occurrences": [{"source_term": "field", "target_term": "域"}, {"source_term": "invertible", "target_term": "可逆"}, {"source_term": "commutative diagram", "target_term": "交换图"}, {"source_term": "finite type", "target_term": "有限型"}, {"source_term": "schemes", "target_term": "概形"}, {"source_term": "canonical map", "target_term": "典范映射"}, {"source_term": "isomorphism", "target_term": "同构"}], "unknown_terms": [{"source_term": "field", "target_term": "域", "context": "底域"}, {"source_term": "invertible", "target_term": "可逆", "context": "系数条件"}, {"source_term": "commutative diagram", "target_term": "交换图", "context": "基变换图"}, {"source_term": "finite type", "target_term": "有限型", "context": "概形条件"}, {"source_term": "schemes", "target_term": "概形", "context": "图中对象"}, {"source_term": "canonical map", "target_term": "典范映射", "context": "基变换映射"}, {"source_term": "isomorphism", "target_term": "同构", "context": "目标结论"}], "notes": []}
{"unit_id": "tag:0F1N:proof", "translation": "我们将其约化到引理<REF_0001>，利用这些函子（functors）与直和（direct sums）交换（commute）这一事实。建议读者跳过证明。回顾导出张量积（derived tensor product）与直和（direct sums）交换（commutes）。回顾（导出的（derived））拉回（pullback）与直和（direct sums）交换（commutes）。回顾<MATH_0001>和<MATH_0002>与直和（direct sums）交换（commute），见引理<REF_0002>和<REF_0003>（这里用到了我们的概形（schemes）是<MATH_0003>上的有限型（finite type）这一事实）。\n\n<STRUCT_0001><STRUCT_0002>\n为完成证明，可以如下论证。首先写成<MATH_0004>。由于这些函子（functors）与直和（direct sums）交换（commute），它们也与同伦（homotopy）余极限（colimits）交换（commute）。因此只需在<MATH_0005>上有界（bounded above）时证明引理。类似地，对于<MATH_0006>可以假设<MATH_0007>上有界（bounded above）。于是可以将<MATH_0008>表示为上有界（bounded above）复形（complex）<MATH_0009>，其各项是<MATH_0010>模（modules）的层（sheaves）。于是\n<MATH_0011>\n（朴素截断（stupid truncations））。因此可以假设<MATH_0012>是一个有界（bounded）复形（complex），其各项是<MATH_0013>模（modules）的层（sheaves）。对于<MATH_0014>，选择上有界（bounded above）复形（complex），其各项是平坦（flat）（！）的<MATH_0015>模（modules）的层（sheaves）。然后约化到<MATH_0016>由有界（bounded）复形（complex）表示的情形，其各项是平坦（flat）的<MATH_0017>模（modules）的层（sheaves）。此时应用引理<REF_0004>而得到结论。\n", "allowed_english": [], "term_occurrences": [{"source_term": "functors", "target_term": "函子"}, {"source_term": "direct sums", "target_term": "直和"}, {"source_term": "commute", "target_term": "交换"}, {"source_term": "derived tensor product", "target_term": "导出张量积"}, {"source_term": "direct sums", "target_term": "直和"}, {"source_term": "commutes", "target_term": "交换"}, {"source_term": "derived", "target_term": "导出的"}, {"source_term": "pullback", "target_term": "拉回"}, {"source_term": "direct sums", "target_term": "直和"}, {"source_term": "commutes", "target_term": "交换"}, {"source_term": "direct sums", "target_term": "直和"}, {"source_term": "commute", "target_term": "交换"}, {"source_term": "schemes", "target_term": "概形"}, {"source_term": "finite type", "target_term": "有限型"}, {"source_term": "functors", "target_term": "函子"}, {"source_term": "direct sums", "target_term": "直和"}, {"source_term": "commute", "target_term": "交换"}, {"source_term": "homotopy", "t